		    				<img decoding="async" src="https://www.elite-concepts.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/PH7_PNG.png" alt="Slide Image">
		    			</div>

		    			<div class="slide-content-infor">
		    				<span class="slide-content-infor-title elite-title">PENTHOUSE</span>
		    				<span class="slide-content-infor-locations">Kowloon</span>
		    				<p>Penthouse, our latest concept is now open. This multi-faceted club is where one can enjoy Modern Chinese Cuisine in both Dinette or within Private Dining Rooms. Enjoy afternoon Chinese Teas from Fook Ming Tong in our lounge, Wine &amp; Cheese pairing in Cellar 31, or chill in our Mr. Deejay Music Room. Join Elite Access as a member now to experience this exclusive new venue. Penthouse is located on 31/F of iSQUARE in Tsim Sha Tsui, right above newly refurbished Nanhai No.1 and eyebar.</p>
		    			</div>
		    		</a>

		    	</div>

		    		            
		    	<div class="swiper-slide elite-btn-hover">

		    		<a href="https://www.elite-concepts.com/our-concepts/hong-kong/ye-shanghai/" class="slide-content" target="_blank">
		    			<div class="slide-content-image" style="background-image:url('https://www.elite-concepts.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/YS-PP.jpg')">
		    				<img decoding="async" src="https://www.elite-concepts.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/OC_yeshanghai_Logo.jpg" alt="Slide Image">
		    			</div>

		    			<div class="slide-content-infor">
		    				<span class="slide-content-infor-title elite-title">yè shanghai</span>
		    				<span class="slide-content-infor-locations">Shanghai, Hong Kong, Kowloon</span>
		    				<p>Welcome to the Shanghai of many moons ago. Stylish, sensuous, alluring Shanghai. ye shanghai is a salute to the past while being a celebration of new ideas and inspirations Embracing the cuisines of neighbouring provinces like Jiangsu and Zhejiang, impeccably presented after braising, roasting quick-frying and steaming</p>
		    			</div>
		    		</a>

		    	</div>

		    		            
		    	<div class="swiper-slide elite-btn-hover">

		    		<a href="https://www.elite-concepts.com/our-concepts/hong-kong/nanhai-no-1/" class="slide-content" target="_blank">
