		    				<img decoding="async" src="https://www.elite-concepts.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/OC_Nanhai1_Logo.jpg" alt="Slide Image">
		    			</div>

		    			<div class="slide-content-infor">
		    				<span class="slide-content-infor-title elite-title">Nanhai No.1</span>
		    				<span class="slide-content-infor-locations">Kowloon</span>
		    				<p>Nanhai No.1 is back after a trip to Malacca. With the same team, same kitchen brigade and your same favorite dishes along with a new menu are ready to surpass your expectations.</p>
		    			</div>
		    		</a>

		    	</div>

		    		            
		    	<div class="swiper-slide elite-btn-hover">

		    		<a href="https://www.elite-concepts.com/our-concepts/hong-kong/nanhai-no-2/" class="slide-content" target="_blank">
