		    			</div>

		    			<div class="slide-content-infor">
		    				<span class="slide-content-infor-title elite-title">Nanhai No.2</span>
		    				<span class="slide-content-infor-locations">Hong Kong</span>
		    				<p>After 12 years, NANHAI is ready to set sail to introduce a new world of tastes and experiences to Hong Kong’s discerning and ever-hungry diners.</p>
		    			</div>
		    		</a>

		    	</div>

		    		            
		    	<div class="swiper-slide elite-btn-hover">

		    		<a href="https://www.elite-concepts.com/our-concepts/hong-kong/deng-g-sichuan/" class="slide-content" target="_blank">
		    			<div class="slide-content-image" style="background-image:url('https://www.elite-concepts.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/DGS-1.jpg')">
