		    				<span class="slide-content-infor-title elite-title">eyebar</span>
		    				<span class="slide-content-infor-locations">Kowloon</span>
		    				<p>This is without a doubt, the most spectacular venue from which to take in an unrivalled view of the Hong Kong island city skyline, while enjoying a relaxing drink. Home of our special signature cocktail the 'Suzie Wrong'</p>
		    			</div>
		    		</a>

