		    				<span class="slide-content-infor-title elite-title">Duck de Chine</span>
		    				<span class="slide-content-infor-locations">Beijing</span>
		    				<p>Duck de Chine is 1949‘s superb restaurant, offering the best duck dishes in Beijing, combined with the most innovative mix and match concept. The new Bollinger Champagne Bar and Lounge in 1949 is even more spacious with extensive vintage collections in store.</p>
		    			</div>
