		    				<p>Welcome to Beijing’s most chic and innovative dining and entertainment complex. 1949 is a city within a city, comprising restaurants, bars, gardens, event spaces, an art gallery, and a private member’s club. It’s like a commune for the connected. Also, check out 1949 – Jin Bao Jie</p>
