<div class="latest-news">

			            
    	<div class="latest-new-card">

    		<div class="card-content">

			    <div class="card-front">
			      	<img decoding="async" src="https://www.elite-concepts.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/CRAB-banner.jpg" alt="Card Image">
			    </div>
			    
			    <div class="card-back">
			     	<div class="card-title elite-title">CRABFEST 2026</div>
			     	<div class="card-date">18 Sep 2026</div>
			     	<p class="card-description">Elite Concepts proudly presents the triumphant return of its highly anticipated annual culinary extravaganza, the Season 11 " CRABFEST " .

Curated by our culinary team, this collection of innovative crab delicacies celebrates the freshest seasonal catch, offering a gastronomic experience for all crab enthusiasts.

This year, yè shanghai—which has garnered a total of 19 Michelin stars since its inception—has invited Chef Jiang, Chef de Cuisine of yè shanghai - Shanghai, to showcase his artisanal creations.

Meanwhile, Chef Deng Huadong of Chef of China 2 (《一飯封神 2》) takes center stage at Deng G , presenting various Sichuan-style crab delicacies that infuse the feast with bold, multifaceted dimensions.

As the season officially kicks off,  our "CRABFEST" strictly selects the finest and freshest to present the following exquisite highlights:


Available Date &amp; Menus:

yè shanghai – Tsim Sha Tsui & Admiralty：28/09 - 15/12/2026
<a href="https://www.elite-concepts.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/crab-menu2026-09_OUTLINE_SMALL.pdf">MENU</a> 

Nanhai no.1：02/10 - 30/11/2026
<a href="https://www.elite-concepts.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/NH1-compressed.pdf">MENU</a>

Nanhai no.2：02/10 - 30/11/2026
<a href="https://www.elite-concepts.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/NH2-compressed.pdf">MENU</a>

Deng G: 17/10 - 30/11/2026
<a href="https://www.elite-concepts.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DNG-compressed.pdf">MENU</a>

PENTHOUSE： 28/09 - 07/11/2026
<a href="https://www.elite-concepts.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/PH.pdf">MENU</a></p>
			     	<a href="https://www.elite-concepts.com/crabfest2026/">Read more</a>
			    </div>

		  </div>

		</div>

    		            
    	<div class="latest-new-card">

    		<div class="card-content">

			    <div class="card-front">
			      	<img decoding="async" src="https://www.elite-concepts.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/avalon_banner.jpg" alt="Card Image">
