			    <div class="card-back">
			     	<div class="card-title elite-title">FIREWORKS FRONT ROW</div>
			     	<div class="card-date">31 Aug 2026</div>
			     	<p class="card-description">With National Day on October 1st, we’re sure everyone is looking forward to a dazzling fireworks display. If you want a front row seat to enjoy the show from at either Nanhai No.1, PENTHOUSE, Deng G or Eyebar, with their stunning views overlooking the harbor, the seats are limited so better book your place now. 


Nanhai No.1 <a href="https://www.elite-concepts.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/南海一號-國慶煙花套餐2026.pdf">>MENU<</a>
Penthouse <a href="https://www.elite-concepts.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/PENTHOUSE-FIREWORKS.pdf">>MENU<</a></p>
			     	<a href="https://www.elite-concepts.com/fireworks-front-row/">Read more</a>
