			    <div class="card-back">
			     	<div class="card-title elite-title">Mid-Autumn Festival Menu 2026</div>
			     	<div class="card-date">10 Aug 2026</div>
			     	<p class="card-description">Elite Concepts has curated a variety of Mid-Autumn set menus for you to celebrate this festive season with your family. These menus feature a range of cuisines including Shanghainese, Sichuanese, and Cantonese. To accommodate your party size, private dining rooms with various capacities are available for your selection. Whether for three generations or small families, this venue is perfect for your consideration.

Available Date &amp; Menus:


